<LessonLayout title="Catechist Guide — The Eucharist" cic="CCC 1322-1419" scripture="">

<section class="content">

<h2>Catechist Guide</h2>
<p class="big-question">For preparing and leading the class.</p>

<h3>Class Summary</h3>

<p><strong>Estimated Duration:</strong> 60 minutes</p>
<p><strong>Central Theme:</strong> The Eucharist</p>
<p><strong>Objectives:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Understand the mystery of the Eucharist as the Body and Blood of Christ.</li>
<li>Discover the sacramental nature of the Eucharist.</li>
<li>Apply this teaching to daily spiritual life.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Key Verse:</strong> Cf. CCC 1322-1419</p>
<p><strong>Catechism References:</strong> CCC 1322-1419</p>

</section>

