<section class="content">

<h3>Notes for the Catechist</h3>

<h4>Doctrinal Points</h4>
<p>Emphasize the Real Presence and the sacrificial nature of the Eucharist. Avoid symbolic interpretations.</p>

<h4>Common Challenges</h4>
<p>Many struggle with belief in the Real Presence. Address doubts gently and with Scripture.</p>

<h4>Age-Specific Adaptations</h4>
<ul>
<li>🌱 Seed: Focus on Jesus being truly present, use simple language.</li>
<li>🌿 Sprouts: Address questions about transubstantiation.</li>
<li>🪴 Root: Deepen understanding of Eucharistic adoration.</li>
<li>🌳 Tree: Explore mystical theology of the Eucharist.</li>
</ul>

</section>

